        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step3" value="3. Service Hardening&#xa;• ปิด Services ไม่จำเป็น&#xa;• เปลี่ยน Default Settings&#xa;• Disable Guest Account" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="314" y="420" width="200" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step4" value="4. Firewall Configuration&#xa;• Default Deny&#xa;• Allow Required Ports&#xa;• Test Rules" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
